* SPICE Netlist

* Voltage Source
VDD 4 0 DC <Voltage_Value>

* PMOS Transistor
M1 3 5 4 4 PMOS

* Capacitor
C1 3 2 <Capacitance_Value>

* Nodes:
* 4 - VDD
* 3 - Connection between PMOS drain and capacitor
* 5 - Gate of PMOS at input vI
* 2 - Ground connection

* Model Parameters
.model PMOS PMOS

.end